 Buraydah, Al Qassim, with businesses across Saudi Arabia.\"},\"insights\":{\"title\":\"Insights\",\"description\":\"Notes from the work itself: what works, what doesn't, and how decisions get made in marketing and technology.\"},\"start\":{\"title\":\"Start a project\",\"description\":\"Tell us the goal and the scope in a few short steps, and we'll come back with a clear starting plan.\"},\"contact\":{\"title\":\"Contact\",\"description\":\"WhatsApp, phone and our location in Buraydah, Al Qassim. We work with businesses across Saudi Arabia.\"},\"privacy\":{\"title\":\"Privacy policy\",\"description\":\"How we handle the data that reaches us through this website.\"},\"terms\":{\"title\":\"Terms \u0026 conditions\",\"description\":\"Terms governing the use of the Seven Lands website and the services presented on it.\"},\"notFound\":{\"title\":\"Page not found\",\"description\":\"The page you're looking for isn't available. Head back home, or pick one of the seven capabilities.\"}},\"home\":{\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Marketing, creative \u0026 technology — Buraydah, Al Qassim\",\"title1\":\"Marketing. Creative. Technology.\",\"title2\":\"Moving in one direction:\",\"titleAccent\":\"growth.\",\"support\":\"Brand, content, campaigns, websites and software — one team working to one commercial goal.\",\"primary\":\"Start a project\",\"secondary\":\"View our work\",\"whatsappLine\":\"Or message us on WhatsApp\",\"pathCaption\":\"Seven capabilities, one path\"},\"trust\":{\"heading\":\"What we can prove today\",\"note\":\"We don't show client logos or numbers we can't verify. Everything on this site reflects how we actually work.\",\"facts\":{\"disciplines\":\"Seven connected capabilities\",\"decision\":\"One decision per project\",\"location\":\"Working from Buraydah, Al Qassim\"}},\"lands\":{\"eyebrow\":\"The system\",\"heading\":\"Seven capabilities. One direction.\",\"lede\":\"Growth rarely comes from one channel alone, or from a good-looking website on its own. Our disciplines work as one connected system, from strategy through to technology.\",\"selectHint\":\"Select a capability to see its detail\",\"nodeCount\":\"Capability {number} of 07\",\"viewLand\":\"View capability\"},\"problems\":{\"eyebrow\":\"The reality\",\"relatedLand\":\"Related capability: {land}\",\"explore\":\"Explore the seven capabilities\"},\"work\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Our work\",\"selected\":\"Selected work\",\"allWork\":\"All work\",\"workPage\":\"The work page\",\"emptyPoints\":[\"Work is published after client approval, not before.\",\"Results are published once real data comes from the official accounts.\",\"If there's nothing publishable yet, we simply say so.\"]},\"process\":{\"eyebrow\":\"How we work\"},\"why\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Why Seven Lands\"},\"finalCta\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Next step\",\"heading1\":\"Have a clear challenge, or the beginning of an idea?\",\"heading2\":\"Let's start there.\",\"body\":\"Send us a short brief or message us on WhatsApp, and we'll agree the right starting point with you.\",\"primary\":\"Start a project\",\"secondary\":\"Message us on WhatsApp\"}},\"services\":{\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Services\",\"title\":\"Seven capabilities working as one system.\",\"lede\":\"Each capability stands on its own. Its real value shows when it works with the others around the same goal.\",\"support\":\"Start with the capability that matches your problem — we can sequence the rest with you later.\"},\"listHeading\":\"Capabilities\",\"crossHeading\":\"Why we don't sell disconnected services\",\"crossBody\":\"Because the problem is rarely in one place. An ad with no clear landing page wastes budget, and a website that doesn't carry a clear message slows the sales team down. We work on the cause, not the symptoms.\",\"capabilitiesLabel\":\"Scope of work\",\"serviceMeta\":\"Capability {number}\"},\"serviceDetail\":{\"outcomeLabel\":\"Outcome\",\"problemsHeading\":\"When you need this\",\"capabilitiesHeading\":\"What we work on\",\"capabilitiesNote\":\"The final scope of work is agreed after the first discovery session.\",\"methodHeading\":\"How we work inside this capability\",\"faqHeading\":\"Common questions\",\"relatedHeading\":\"Related work\",\"relatedEmpty\":\"No published work in this capability yet.\",\"ctaHeading\":\"We can start here.\",\"ctaBody\":\"Tell us where you are today and we'll come back with a clear view of where to start, before any commitment.\",\"otherLands\":\"Other capabilities\"},\"work\":{\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Our work\",\"title\":\"Our work\",\"lede\":\"We show what we can discuss in detail, with the client's agreement.\"},\"filtersLabel\":\"Filter\",\"caseStudyLabels\":{\"challenge\":\"Challenge\",\"objective\":\"Objective\",\"approach\":\"Approach\",\"execution\":\"Execution\",\"gallery\":\"Gallery\",\"results\":\"Results\",\"scope\":\"Scope\",\"sector\":\"Sector\",\"next\":\"Next project\"},\"resultsNote\":\"Results are published once verified client data is available.\"},\"insights\":{\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Insights\",\"title\":\"Insights\",\"lede\":\"Notes from the work itself, with no filler to fill a page.\"},\"backToInsights\":\"All insights\"},\"about\":{\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"About\",\"title\":\"We build the brand. We reach the audience. We develop the technology that moves the business.\",\"lede\":\"Seven Lands is a Saudi company bringing marketing, creative, technology and business growth together, working from Buraydah in Al Qassim.\"},\"storyHeading\":\"Why seven capabilities?\",\"story\":[\"Marketing separated from technology ends in incomplete projects: a campaign that works with a page that doesn't convince, or a good-looking website the sales team can't use.\",\"So we organised our work into seven connected capabilities. Each one is a clear discipline, and the connection between them is where the difference shows — because the decision stays one decision, from the first session to measurement.\",\"We don't promise everything to everyone. We define what your project actually needs, then plan, build and measure on that basis.\"],\"principlesHeading\":\"How we work\",\"locationHeading\":\"Where we work\",\"locationBody\":\"We're based in Buraydah, Al Qassim, and work with businesses across Saudi Arabia — remotely, or on site depending on the project.\",\"teamHeading\":\"The team\",\"teamNote\":\"We don't publish team names or photos before they're approved. The team appears here once official details are supplied.\",\"factsHeading\":\"In detail\",\"factsModel\":\"Working model\",\"factsModelValue\":\"Seven connected capabilities under one direction\",\"factsStart\":\"How we start\",\"factsStartValue\":\"A discovery session, then a clear scope and timeline\",\"factsArea\":\"Service area\",\"factsAreaValue\":\"All regions of Saudi Arabia\"},\"start\":{\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Start a project\",\"title\":\"Let's start from the goal.\",\"lede\":\"A few short steps, no long form. The minimum detail is enough for us to come back with a plan.\"},\"stepIndicator\":\"Step {current} of {total}\",\"steps\":{\"need\":{\"title\":\"What would you like us to work on?\",\"help\":\"Pick the closest fit and we'll sequence the rest with you. You can choose more than one capability.\"},\"goal\":{\"title\":\"Tell us briefly about the project.\",\"help\":\"Write it in your own words: where you are, and where you want to get to.\"},\"timing\":{\"title\":\"When do you want to start?\",\"help\":\"Timing helps us prioritise.\"},\"contact\":{\"title\":\"Contact details\",\"help\":\"Used only to reply to this request.\"}},\"fields\":{\"lands\":\"Capabilities needed\",\"landOther\":\"Not sure yet — I need guidance\",\"goal\":\"Short description\",\"goalPlaceholder\":\"Example: we sell online and need a page that convinces customers, plus a campaign with proper measurement.\",\"timeline\":\"Timeline\",\"timelineOptions\":{\"now\":\"Within a month\",\"quarter\":\"One to three months\",\"later\":\"Three to six months\",\"unsure\":\"Not decided yet\"},\"name\":\"Name\",\"company\":\"Business / company\",\"companyOptional\":\"Optional\",\"phone\":\"Mobile number\",\"phoneHint\":\"Example: 0507776891\",\"email\":\"Email\",\"channel\":\"Preferred contact method\",\"channelOptions\":{\"whatsapp\":\"WhatsApp\",\"call\":\"Phone call\"},\"notes\":\"Anything else\",\"consent\":\"I agree that my details may be used to contact me about this request, per the privacy policy.\"},\"buttons\":{\"next\":\"Next\",\"back\":\"Back\",\"submit\":\"Send project details\",\"submitting\":\"Sending…\"},\"errors\":{\"lands\":\"Select at least one capability\",\"goal\":\"Please describe this in a few words (at least 10 characters)\",\"timeline\":\"Please choose a timeline\",\"name\":\"Please enter your name\",\"phone\":\"Enter a valid Saudi mobile number\",\"email\":\"Enter a valid email address\",\"consent\":\"Consent is required to send the request\",\"generic\":\"The request couldn't be sent. Try again, or message us on WhatsApp.\"},\"success\":{\"title\":\"We've got your details.\",\"body\":\"We'll get back to you on the details you sent. If you'd rather send the summary straight to WhatsApp, the button below prepares the message with the same information.\",\"whatsapp\":\"Send the summary on WhatsApp\",\"again\":\"Send another request\"},\"aside\":{\"heading\":\"What happens next\",\"points\":[\"We review the request and flag anything that needs clarifying.\",\"We reply on the channel you chose.\",\"A short discovery session, then a clear scope and timeline.\"],\"note\":\"We use your details only to reply to this request.\"}},\"contact\":{\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Contact\",\"title\":\"Contact us\",\"lede\":\"WhatsApp is the fastest way to reach us. For new projects, use the project brief form.\"},\"channelsHeading\":\"Contact channels\",\"phoneLabel\":\"Phone \u0026 WhatsApp\",\"locationLabel\":\"Location\",\"hoursLabel\":\"Business hours\",\"pendingValue\":\"To be confirmed\",\"formHeading\":\"Quick enquiry\",\"formHelp\":\"For new projects, the brief form tells us more.\",\"startInstead\":\"Use the project brief form\"},\"legal\":{\"draftNotice\":\"This page is under legal review before official launch.\",\"lastUpdated\":\"Last updated\",\"privacy\":{\"intro\":\"This policy explains how Seven Lands handles data that reaches us through sevnland.com.\",\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"Data we collect\",\"body\":\"We collect what you send us through the website forms: name, contact details and the information you provide about your project. We also collect general usage data for measurement.\"},{\"title\":\"How we use it\",\"body\":\"We use your details to respond to your request, deliver agreed work and improve the website. We do not sell your data or share it with third parties for marketing purposes.\"},{\"title\":\"Sharing\",\"body\":\"We may use technical service providers (hosting, analytics, WhatsApp) to operate the site and communicate. Their access is limited to what operation requires.\"},{\"title\":\"Retention\",\"body\":\"We keep request data for as long as needed to follow up on the work, or until you ask us to delete it.\"},{\"title\":\"Your rights\",\"body\":\"You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of your data through the contact channel published on the contact page.\"}]},\"terms\":{\"intro\":\"These terms govern the use of sevnland.com and the information published on it.\",\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"Scope of work\",\"body\":\"This website describes our services and the way we work. The details of each project — scope, timeline and fee — are agreed in a written proposal approved by both sides before work begins.\"},{\"title\":\"Use of the site\",\"body\":\"You may not use this site or its content in any way that violates the regulations in force in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia.\"},{\"title\":\"Intellectual property\",\"body\":\"All marks and materials published on the site are owned by Seven Lands or used under licence, and may not be reused without written permission.\"},{\"title\":\"